  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 370360320
    m_Localized: Starter Stream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274880
    m_Localized: Learn the ropes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274881
    m_Localized: Your first season live. Dependable regulars, a couple of moderators,
      Doge and Cheems, and three friendly Diamonds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274882
    m_Localized: Cat Cafe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274883
    m_Localized: The internet runs on animals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274884
    m_Localized: Every animal meme in one room. Bongo Cat buffs the whole zoo, Nyan
      Cat chains arrivals, Doge rewards variety and Big Chungus needs a big Sub Cap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274885
    m_Localized: Doomscroll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274886
    m_Localized: Swatting Risk is good content
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274887
    m_Localized: Wojaks feed on suffering. Doomer and Me Gusta love Swatting Risk,
      Gigachad and Sigma want the spotlight alone, and This Is Fine Dog keeps the
      SWAT team guessing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274888
    m_Localized: Italian Brainrot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274889
    m_Localized: Tung tung tung tung
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274890
    m_Localized: Chaos on a loop. Strikes, shuffles, bombardments and infections.
      Pop Cat and Dancing Baby turn every action into Subs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274891
    m_Localized: Reaction Channel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274892
    m_Localized: Control the narrative
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274893
    m_Localized: Manipulators and schemers. Rearrange the queue, swap, zero and double
      stats, convert Subs to Cash and back, and protect your stars from bad luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274894
    m_Localized: Random Mix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274895
    m_Localized: A fresh character set every time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274896
    m_Localized: Eleven random viewers and three random Diamonds. Win five in a row
      to earn the Cherry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274897
    m_Localized: Open Lobby
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274898
    m_Localized: Everyone's welcome (sandbox)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274899
    m_Localized: Every recruitable viewer is in the shop. Great for experimenting;
      does not count toward progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274900
    m_Localized: Bedroom Setup
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274901
    m_Localized: RGB strips, a ring light and a bed that's definitely in frame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274902
    m_Localized: IRL Beach Stream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274903
    m_Localized: Sunset, seagulls and a phone on a selfie stick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274904
    m_Localized: Neon City IRL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274905
    m_Localized: Streaming from a rooftop. The skyline glows. So does chat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274906
    m_Localized: Content House
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274907
    m_Localized: Ten creators, one kitchen, zero privacy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274908
    m_Localized: Cursed 3AM Stream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274909
    m_Localized: Don't read the chat. Don't look behind you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274910
    m_Localized: Metaverse Lounge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274911
    m_Localized: Everyone is a floating torso. Nobody has legs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274912
    m_Localized: Studio Stage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274913
    m_Localized: Green screen, smoke machine, legendary clips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274914
    m_Localized: Debate Bunker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274915
    m_Localized: Three monitors, two arguments, one very loud microphone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274916
    m_Localized: Podcast Studio
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274917
    m_Localized: Wood panels, neon sign, elk jerky. Episode four hundred and twenty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274918
    m_Localized: Pro Gamer Dojo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274919
    m_Localized: Blue LEDs, an energy drink fridge and a headband on a pedestal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274920
    m_Localized: Screaming Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274921
    m_Localized: Acoustic foam, a football and something on fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274922
    m_Localized: Giveaway Warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274923
    m_Localized: Pallets of cash, a countdown clock and a lot of very nervous contestants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274924
    m_Localized: The Mansion (Socialist Edition)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274925
    m_Localized: A two-million-dollar living room with a hammer-and-sickle throw
      pillow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274926
    m_Localized: Gym of Feelings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274927
    m_Localized: Dumbbells, a punching bag and a box of tissues. For the punching
      bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274928
    m_Localized: Chessboard Arena
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274929
    m_Localized: Sixty-four squares, two heads and zero inside voices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274930
    m_Localized: Pal Meadow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274931
    m_Localized: Pastel hills, fluffy creatures and a suspicious number of capture
      spheres.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274932
    m_Localized: Blackboard Void
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274933
    m_Localized: An infinite dark canvas where vectors gently rotate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274934
    m_Localized: Champions Club Arena
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 433274935
    m_Localized: Smoke, lasers, a lightbox of X-rays and a very large trophy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
